+# Backend pointers
+
+Conventions checked by ast-grep (`ast-grep scan -c sgconfig.suggestions.yml <files>`) that shape code before it is written:
+- Time: inject `java.time.Clock` and call `now(clock)`, never `now()` without one (gen-clock-now).
+- List endpoints take a `Pageable` and return one page (gen-paged-list-endpoints).
+- Transactions open in services, not in resources or repositories (gen-no-transactional-in-web-or-repository).
+- Custom properties go into `ApplicationProperties`, not loose `@Value` (gen-no-loose-value-property).
+- Async work uses `@Async` with the `AsyncConfiguration` executor, never hand-made threads (gen-no-manual-threads).
+- New classes go into an existing layer package; a new top-level package needs an architecture decision (gen-no-new-top-level-package).
